  "description": "After School Enrollment records dismissal route, weekly schedule, program capacity, snack plan, late pickup, and classroom handoff. After School Enrollment evidence stays linked.",
  "use_case": "Use this after school enrollment time-ordered tracking when staff must document dismissal route and weekly schedule. Reconcile program capacity, snack plan, late pickup, and classroom handoff before the after school enrollment handoff. Useful evidence includes the enrollment request, bell schedule, weekly roster, pickup authorization, snack-plan reference, and late-pickup contact log. Ask the assigned after school enrollment reviewer to confirm dismissal route against the organization's policy.",
